{"server":"en","storyId":"main_4_level_main_04-10_beg","groupId":"main_4","stageId":"main_04-10","title":"Extinguished Flames","storyCode":"4-10","avgTag":"Before Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-10_beg.txt","sourceHash":"9e124154267612c089ace715dffb90b9422ca6671d1b6d5edbc9015733429f02","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"FrostNova's overwhelming power forces the group into a fight for their survival.\nBut now more than ever, it's do or die.","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第四十关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_40_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"The temperature... is dropping sharply?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"There's ice forming on the ground..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"It's so cold..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Unbelievable... even the burning effigy was frozen over....!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"The flames were put out... Dark clouds have covered the sky..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Aaahh...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Don't panic!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Jessica, Blacksteel operator!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Yes!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Stay in position!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Roger!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"What are you doing, Frostleaf?!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_6"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"She's... draining all the heat from her surroundings!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I never knew she was able to affect such a wide area!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Heh... Master of the Yetis..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"I've never met... anyone with a lower body temperature than mine."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Frostleaf!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Meteorite... To be honest, I wanted to..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Distract her... and buy some time for you..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"You..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"But... my body... is completely frozen."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"I can't... move my feet anymore."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Frostleaf! !"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya, take them with you, and fight your way out of here."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"In less than a minute, the enemy commander... will have frozen this entire square."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't make me die for nothing."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya... We can't... I won't leave her!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I understand."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I won't leave Frostleaf behind."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I will not... leave anyone behind!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I'll hold off the enemy squads' movements."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Meteorite... I'm counting on you to bring Frostleaf back!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Roger!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Doctor! Please lead our squads!"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Way ahead of you!","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"(Nod)","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"Affirmative!","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Now that I think about it..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"I've only used these Arts once before."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"'Wherever there is blood...'"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"Hah."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"So you want to use your ice... to counter mine?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Nnh...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"How will you do that if you can't even use your tongue anymore?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"You..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"Yeti Squadron, spread out."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Roger."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"My brethren..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"Flush them out, and freeze their blood."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Understood."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"'...Your mind can hide nothing from me.'"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"An incantation?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"The rabbit of Rhodes Island..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Black... lines? ...What the hell is that?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Wh-what kind of Arts is that--"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"W-wait, why is that thing... worming past our barriers? !"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't--"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"...Aaaaaghh!!!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"M-my body! It's on fire...! It's burning!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Meteorite!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"I know!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Please, keep distracting them!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"N-n-no... so cold...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Nnngh... it hurts so much!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"...Gaah... No, no more..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"Hurry! Don't let them hurt our comrades any further!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Understood!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"Your Originium Arts... are very formidable."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Nnh... aagh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Damn you... Get away... from me..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Nnnh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"I won't give you a chance to use your Arts, girl."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"Now, close your eyes and sleep."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"I'll put you out of your misery soon."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Th-this witch...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"I take it that you're Amiya."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"I like the look in your eyes."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"That is how a warrior should look."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm sorry..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Why are you..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......♬"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"——♪——♬——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"What's going on here?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"——♬——♬——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...It's snowing?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"'Sleep, my children. Sleep."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"Hedgehog dolls and teddy bears...'......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"This strange melody..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"...She's casting her Arts!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"'Sink quietly into black...♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"...My broken puppets and dolls♬'"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Even more shards of black ice are appearing out of thin air?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"The ice shards are slowly falling onto the ground!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Shoot, the ground is freezing wherever the shards fall...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"The black ice..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"It's spreading...?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"The ice crystals are eroding everything around us!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't let her finish her song! !"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Rhodes Island, we're going all out!","value":"1","blocks":[]}]}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["Amiya"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["Reunion Member"]},{"speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","aliases":["FrostNova"]},{"speakerId":"char_193_frostl","aliases":["Frostleaf"]},{"speakerId":"char_219_meteo","aliases":["Jessica","Meteorite"]}]}
